ATH_0057> is the generic point, the difference\n<MATH_0058> is equal to <MATH_0059> by\nTopology, Lemma <REF_0005>.\nThis is equal to <MATH_0060> by\nProperties, Lemma\n<REF_0006>.\nHence we conclude that\n<MATH_0061>\nand the lemma follows from what we said above about <MATH_0062>.\n",
